%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6e68035b0b6c8a418e4ba69a861bf1d, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueDatabase
  entries:
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Evening. You got a spot where I can see the rig from the window?
      textKo: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC2DC\uC624. \uCC3D\uC5D0\uC11C \uD2B8\uB7ED\uC774
        \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uBC29 \uD558\uB098 \uC788\uC18C?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night. I roll out before the sun's up.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uBA74 \uB418\uC624. \uD574 \uB728\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0
        \uCD9C\uBC1C\uD560 \uAC70\uB77C\uC11C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Been on the road eighteen hours. My eyes are done.
      textKo: "\uC5F4\uC5EC\uB35F \uC2DC\uAC04\uC744 \uB2EC\uB838\uC18C. \uB208\uC774
        \uC548 \uB5A0\uC9C0\uB294\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: name
    labelEn: Ask their name
    labelKo: "\uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: It's on the log sheet. Nobody reads those anyway.
      textKo: "\uC6B4\uD589 \uC77C\uC9C0\uC5D0 \uC801\uD600 \uC788\uC18C. \uBB50
        \uC544\uBB34\uB3C4 \uC548 \uC77D\uC9C0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: haul
    labelEn: Ask what he's hauling
    labelKo: "\uBB34\uC5C7\uC744 \uC2E3\uACE0 \uAC00\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Dry freight. Boxes. I don't open the trailer and I don't ask.
      textKo: "\uB9C8\uB978 \uD654\uBB3C. \uC0C1\uC790\uC694. \uB098\uB294 \uC9D0\uCE78\uC744
        \uC548 \uC5F4\uACE0, \uBB54\uC9C0\uB3C4 \uC548 \uBB3B\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: where
    labelEn: Ask where he's headed
    labelKo: "\uC5B4\uB514\uB85C \uAC00\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: North. The delivery address changed twice since I left. Still says
        a town I've never heard of.
      textKo: "\uBD81\uCABD\uC774\uC624. \uCD9C\uBC1C\uD55C \uB4A4\uB85C \uBC30\uC1A1\uC9C0\uAC00
        \uB450 \uBC88 \uBC14\uB00C\uC5C8\uC18C. \uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uBCF8
        \uC801\uB3C4 \uC5C6\uB294 \uB3D9\uB124\uB85C \uB3FC \uC788\uACE0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Confirm how long he's staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night. I told you. Gone by first light.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24. \uB9D0\uD588\uC796\uC18C. \uB3D9\uD2B8\uBA74 \uB5A0\uB098\uC624."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Take the night up front
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58\uB97C \uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Settle when he leaves
      labelKo: "\uB098\uAC08 \uB54C \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uAE30\uB85C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_trust
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front. Fine. Company card. It clears.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC774\uB77C. \uC88B\uC18C. \uBC95\uC778 \uCE74\uB4DC\uC694.
        \uC2B9\uC778\uB420 \uAC70\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_trust
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: When I leave, then. Less to fumble for in the dark.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uB098\uAC08 \uB54C. \uC5B4\uB450\uC6B8 \uB54C \uC9C0\uAC11
        \uB4A4\uC9C8 \uC77C \uC5C6\uACE0 \uC88B\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Come in whenever. I won't be in it much.
      textKo: "\uC544\uBB34 \uB54C\uB098 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC624\uC2DC\uC624. \uBC29\uC5D0
        \uC624\uB798 \uC788\uC744 \uAC83\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Tidy the room in the morning
      labelKo: "\uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uBC29\uC744 \uC815\uB9AC\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Leave it be
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB454\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Sure. Just don't move my boots if they're by the door.
      textKo: "\uC88B\uC18C. \uBB38 \uC606\uC5D0 \uBD80\uCE20 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74
        \uADF8\uAC83\uB9CC \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uB9C8\uC2DC\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Even easier. Suits me.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uB354 \uD3B8\uD558\uC9C0. \uC88B\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn him away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No room? I can't drive another mile. Not tonight.
      textKo: "\uBC29\uC774 \uC5C6\uB2E4\uACE0? \uD55C \uB9C8\uC77C\uB3C4 \uB354
        \uBABB \uAC00\uC624. \uC624\uB298 \uBC24\uC740 \uC548 \uB418\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I'll sleep in the cab if I have to. Just let me park it lit.
      textKo: "\uC815 \uC548 \uB418\uBA74 \uC6B4\uC804\uC11D\uC5D0\uC11C \uC790\uACA0\uC18C.
        \uBD88 \uCF1C\uC9C4 \uB370 \uC138\uC6B0\uAE30\uB9CC \uD558\uAC8C \uD574 \uC8FC\uC2DC\uC624."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uD638\uD558\uAC8C \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Let him park and stay
      labelKo: "\uB300\uACE0 \uBB35\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Alright. I've slept in that cab plenty. One more night won't kill
        me.
      textKo: "...\uC54C\uACA0\uC18C. \uADF8 \uC6B4\uC804\uC11D\uC5D0\uC11C \uC231\uD558\uAC8C
        \uC7A4\uC18C. \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24 \uB354 \uC794\uB2E4\uACE0 \uC8FD\uAE30\uC57C
        \uD558\uACA0\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Appreciate it. You won't hear the engine till morning.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC18C. \uC544\uCE68\uAE4C\uC9C4 \uC5D4\uC9C4 \uC18C\uB9AC
        \uC548 \uB0BC \uAC70\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: There. Paid. Now point me at the bed.
      textKo: "\uC790. \uB0C8\uC18C. \uC774\uC81C \uCE68\uB300\uB098 \uAC00\uB9AC\uCF1C
        \uC8FC\uC2DC\uC624."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Appreciate it. You won't hear the engine till morning.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC18C. \uC544\uCE68\uAE4C\uC9C4 \uC5D4\uC9C4 \uC18C\uB9AC
        \uC548 \uB0BC \uAC70\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: You again. I was just at the window.
      textKo: "\uB610 \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774\uC624. \uBC29\uAE08 \uCC3D\uAC00\uC5D0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Gravel. Out by the rig. Like someone walking a slow circle around it.
      textKo: "\uC790\uAC08 \uC18C\uB9AC. \uD2B8\uB7ED \uCABD\uC5D0\uC11C. \uB204\uAC00
        \uADF8 \uC8FC\uC704\uB97C \uCC9C\uCC9C\uD788 \uD55C \uBC14\uD034 \uB3C4\uB294
        \uAC83\uCC98\uB7FC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: truck
    labelEn: Ask about his truck
    labelKo: "\uADF8\uC758 \uD2B8\uB7ED\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Cab light was on. I never leave it on. And the door was open on the
        driver's side.
      textKo: "\uC6B4\uC804\uC11D \uB4F1\uC774 \uCF1C\uC838 \uC788\uC5C8\uC18C. \uB098\uB294
        \uADF8\uAC78 \uC808\uB300 \uC548 \uCF1C\uB450\uB294\uB370. \uC6B4\uC804\uC11D
        \uBB38\uB3C4 \uC5F4\uB824 \uC788\uC5C8\uACE0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: leaving
    labelEn: Ask when he's leaving
    labelKo: "\uC5B8\uC81C \uB5A0\uB0A0 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Soon as it's light enough to see the road. I don't like this lot in
        the dark.
      textKo: "\uAE38\uC774 \uBCF4\uC77C \uB9CC\uD07C \uBC1D\uC544\uC9C0\uBA74 \uBC14\uB85C.
        \uC5B4\uB450\uC6B8 \uB54C \uC774 \uC8FC\uCC28\uC7A5\uC740 \uC601 \uB9C8\uC74C\uC5D0
        \uC548 \uB4DC\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A quiet room, if you have one. My boy's worn out.
      textKo: "\uC870\uC6A9\uD55C \uBC29\uC774\uBA74 \uC88B\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC560\uAC00 \uC9C0\uCCD0\uC11C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just the two of us. One night, maybe two.
      textKo: "\uC800\uD76C \uB458\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24, \uC5B4\uCA4C\uBA74
        \uC774\uD2C0."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: He doesn't talk to strangers. Don't take it personally.
      textKo: "\uC560\uAC00 \uB0AF\uC120 \uC0AC\uB78C\uD558\uACE0\uB294 \uB9D0\uC744
        \uC548 \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC11C\uC6B4\uD574 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: name
    labelEn: Ask their name
    labelKo: "\uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mine's on the card. His isn't on anything. He's just my boy.
      textKo: "\uC81C \uAC74 \uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC5D0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC560
        \uAC74 \uC544\uBB34 \uB370\uB3C4 \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694. \uADF8\uB0E5 \uC81C
        \uC544\uB4E4\uC774\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: boy
    labelEn: Ask about his son
    labelKo: "\uC544\uB4E4\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: He's been like this since his mother. Quiet. Watches a lot. He's no
        trouble.
      textKo: "\uC5C4\uB9C8 \uC77C \uC774\uD6C4\uB85C \uACC4\uC18D \uC774\uB798\uC694.
        \uC870\uC6A9\uD558\uACE0. \uAC00\uB9CC\uD788 \uCCD0\uB2E4\uBCF4\uACE0. \uB9D0\uC37D\uC740
        \uC548 \uBD80\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how long they're staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night to start. I'll tell you in the morning if we need another.
      textKo: "\uC77C\uB2E8 \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uC694. \uD558\uB8E8 \uB354 \uD544\uC694\uD558\uBA74
        \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB9B4\uAC8C\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Charge one night up front
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58\uB97C \uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Settle it later
      labelKo: "\uB098\uC911\uC5D0 \uC815\uC0B0\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_trust
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front. Of course. Here - for the one night.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC774\uC694. \uADF8\uB7FC\uC694. \uC5EC\uAE30 - \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_trust
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. Makes it easier, carrying him and all.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC560\uB97C \uC548\uACE0 \uB2E4\uB2C8\uB290\uB77C,
        \uADF8\uAC8C \uD3B8\uD558\uB124\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Please don't come in during the day. He naps, and he startles.
      textKo: "\uB0AE\uC5D0\uB294 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC624\uC9C0 \uB9D0\uC544 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694.
        \uC560\uAC00 \uB0AE\uC7A0\uC744 \uC790\uB294\uB370, \uC798 \uB180\uB78D\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Respect that - leave the room
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB807\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4 - \uBC29\uC740 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    - labelEn: Insist on a morning tidy
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uC544\uCE68 \uCCAD\uC18C\uB97C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. Really. He needs the room to feel the same.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC815\uB9D0\uB85C\uC694. \uC560\uB294
        \uBC29\uC774 \uB298 \uB611\uAC19\uC544\uC57C \uC548\uC2EC\uD574\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...If you must. Knock first. Loudly. Give him time to hide.
      textKo: "...\uC815 \uADF8\uB7EC\uC154\uC57C \uD55C\uB2E4\uBA74. \uBA3C\uC800
        \uB178\uD06C\uD558\uC138\uC694. \uD06C\uAC8C. \uC560\uAC00 \uC228\uC744 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC744
        \uC8FC\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: With a child? At this hour?
      textKo: "\uC560\uB97C \uB370\uB9AC\uACE0\uC694? \uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC5D0?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Look at him. He can barely keep his eyes open. Please.
      textKo: "\uC560 \uC880 \uBCF4\uC138\uC694. \uB208\uB3C4 \uBABB \uB728\uACE0
        \uC788\uC796\uC544\uC694. \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uD638\uD558\uAC8C \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Let them in
      labelKo: "\uB4E4\uC5EC\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Come on. We'll find the car warm enough.
      textKo: "...\uAC00\uC790. \uCC28 \uC548\uC774 \uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uB530\uB73B\uD560
        \uAC70\uC57C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You won't even know he's here.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC560\uAC00 \uC788\uB294 \uC904\uB3C4
        \uBAA8\uB974\uC2E4 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: There. Paid. Say thank you to the man - ...he's shy.
      textKo: "\uC5EC\uAE30\uC694. \uB0C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC544\uC800\uC528\uD55C\uD14C
        \uC778\uC0AC\uD574\uC57C\uC9C0 - ...\uC560\uAC00 \uBD80\uB044\uB7FC\uC774
        \uB9CE\uC544\uC11C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You won't even know he's here.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC560\uAC00 \uC788\uB294 \uC904\uB3C4
        \uBAA8\uB974\uC2E4 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Keep your voice down. He's finally asleep.
      textKo: "\uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC \uB0AE\uCDB0 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694. \uC774\uC81C\uC57C
        \uACA8\uC6B0 \uC7A0\uB4E4\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: That was him. Talking in his sleep. He does that. It's nothing.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC74 \uC560\uC608\uC694. \uC7A0\uAF2C\uB300\uC694. \uC6D0\uB798
        \uADF8\uB798\uC694. \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2D9\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: voices
    labelEn: Ask why it sounded like more than one child
    labelKo: "\uC65C \uC544\uC774\uAC00 \uC5EC\uB7FF\uC778 \uAC83\uCC98\uB7FC \uB4E4\uB838\uB294\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...It's a small room. Voices bounce. It's just him. It's always just
        him.
      textKo: "...\uBC29\uC774 \uC881\uC544\uC11C\uC694. \uC18C\uB9AC\uAC00 \uC6B8\uB824\uC694.
        \uC560 \uD558\uB098\uBFD0\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. \uB298 \uC560 \uD558\uB098\uBFD0\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: seen
    labelEn: Ask if he saw anything in the hall
    labelKo: "\uBCF5\uB3C4\uC5D0\uC11C \uBB58 \uBABB \uBD24\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I don't leave him alone to go looking. Whatever you heard, it wasn't
        us.
      textKo: "\uC560\uB97C \uD63C\uC790 \uB450\uACE0 \uB098\uAC00\uC11C \uC0B4\uD53C\uC9C4
        \uC54A\uC544\uC694. \uBB58 \uB4E4\uC73C\uC168\uB4E0, \uC6B0\uB9B0 \uC544\uB2D9\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Evening. I'll want a room that faces the walkway, if that's an option.
      textKo: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694. \uAC00\uB2A5\uD558\uBA74 \uBCF5\uB3C4
        \uCABD\uC744 \uBCF4\uB294 \uBC29\uC73C\uB85C \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A night or two. Depends on the light.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uB098 \uC774\uD2C0\uC774\uC694. \uBE5B\uC5D0
        \uB530\uB77C \uB2EC\uB77C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Don't mind the bag. It's just cameras.
      textKo: "\uAC00\uBC29\uC740 \uC2E0\uACBD \uC4F0\uC9C0 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694. \uADF8\uB0E5
        \uCE74\uBA54\uB77C\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: name
    labelEn: Ask their name
    labelKo: "\uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: It's on my ID. The work doesn't have my name on it, if that's what
        you're asking.
      textKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC5D0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC791\uC5C5\uBB3C\uC5D4
        \uC81C \uC774\uB984\uC774 \uC548 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC00\uC694, \uADF8\uAC78 \uBB3C\uC73C\uC2E0
        \uAC70\uB77C\uBA74."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: shoot
    labelEn: Ask what he's photographing
    labelKo: "\uBB34\uC5C7\uC744 \uCD2C\uC601\uD558\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The building. The corridor, mostly. Places people pass through without
        looking.
      textKo: "\uAC74\uBB3C\uC774\uC694. \uB300\uBD80\uBD84\uC740 \uBCF5\uB3C4. \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC774
        \uC548 \uBCF4\uACE0 \uC9C0\uB098\uCE58\uB294 \uC790\uB9AC\uB4E4\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Ask who it's for
      labelKo: "\uB204\uAD6C \uC758\uB8B0\uC778\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: shoot_client
    - labelEn: Let it go
      labelKo: "\uB118\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: shoot_client
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Nobody, yet. Some pictures you take first and find the buyer after.
        This is one of those.
      textKo: "\uC544\uC9C1 \uC544\uBB34\uB3C4\uC694. \uC5B4\uB5A4 \uC0AC\uC9C4\uC740
        \uBA3C\uC800 \uCC0D\uACE0 \uB098\uC911\uC5D0 \uC0B4 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC744 \uCC3E\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uAC8C \uADF8\uB7F0 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: traffic
    labelEn: Ask about the foot traffic remark
    labelKo: "\uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uB9CE\uC774 \uB2E4\uB2C8\uB0D0\uB358 \uB9D0\uC744
      \uB418\uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just curious how busy that hallway gets after dark. It photographs...
        fuller than it should.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uADF8 \uBCF5\uB3C4\uAC00 \uBC24\uC5D0 \uC5BC\uB9C8\uB098
        \uBD90\uBE44\uB098 \uAD81\uAE08\uD574\uC11C\uC694. \uC0AC\uC9C4\uC5D0\uB294...
        \uC788\uC5B4\uC57C \uD560 \uAC83\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uAF49 \uCC28\uAC8C \uB098\uC624\uB354\uB77C\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how long he's staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two nights. If the shot doesn't come by then it isn't coming.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0\uC774\uC694. \uADF8\uB54C\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uC6D0\uD558\uB294
        \uCEF7\uC774 \uC548 \uB098\uC624\uBA74 \uC548 \uB098\uC624\uB294 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Take it up front
      labelKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Let him settle after
      labelKo: "\uB098\uC911\uC5D0 \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_trust
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front's fine. Cash. Photographers always have cash.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88 \uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD604\uAE08\uC774\uC694. \uC0AC\uC9C4\uAC00\uB294
        \uB298 \uD604\uAE08\uC744 \uAC16\uACE0 \uB2E4\uB140\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_trust
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: After, then. I'll leave it under the door if I'm out early.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uB098\uC911\uC5D0\uC694. \uC77C\uCC0D \uB098\uAC00\uBA74
        \uBB38 \uBC11\uC5D0 \uB123\uC5B4\uB450\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mornings are fine. Don't touch the camera on the tripod. It's aimed.
      textKo: "\uC544\uCE68\uC740 \uAD1C\uCC2E\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0BC\uAC01\uB300
        \uC704 \uCE74\uBA54\uB77C\uB294 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694.
        \uC870\uC900\uD574 \uB454 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Tidy each morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uC815\uB9AC\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Leave the room
      labelKo: "\uBC29\uC740 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Good. Just work around the tripod. Don't turn it.
      textKo: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0BC\uAC01\uB300\uB9CC \uD53C\uD574\uC11C\uC694.
        \uB3CC\uB9AC\uC9C0\uB294 \uB9C8\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Even better. The frame stays exactly where I set it.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uB354 \uC88B\uC8E0. \uAD6C\uB3C4\uAC00 \uC81C\uAC00
        \uC7A1\uC544\uB454 \uADF8\uB300\uB85C \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: That's a shame. The light here is very specific.
      textKo: "\uC544\uC27D\uB124\uC694. \uC5EC\uAE30 \uBE5B\uC774 \uC544\uC8FC \uD2B9\uC774\uD55C\uB370."
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I can shoot from the lot. I'd rather have a door, but I don't need
        one.
      textKo: "\uC8FC\uCC28\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uCC0D\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uBC29\uC774 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74 \uC88B\uC9C0\uB9CC, \uAF2D \uD544\uC694\uD558\uC9C4
        \uC54A\uC544\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uD638\uD558\uAC8C \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Give him a room
      labelKo: "\uBC29\uC744 \uC900\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Alright. I'll set up across the road. You won't notice me.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uAE38 \uAC74\uB108\uD3B8\uC5D0 \uC790\uB9AC
        \uC7A1\uC8E0. \uC788\uB294 \uC904\uB3C4 \uBAA8\uB974\uC2E4 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. I'll be quiet. The camera does all the work anyway.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC870\uC6A9\uD788 \uC788\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC5B4\uCC28\uD53C \uC77C\uC740 \uCE74\uBA54\uB77C\uAC00 \uB2E4 \uD558\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Paid. Now - which way does that corridor run?
      textKo: "\uB0C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB7F0\uB370 - \uADF8 \uBCF5\uB3C4\uAC00
        \uC5B4\uB290 \uCABD\uC73C\uB85C \uB098 \uC788\uC8E0?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. I'll be quiet. The camera does all the work anyway.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC870\uC6A9\uD788 \uC788\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC5B4\uCC28\uD53C \uC77C\uC740 \uCE74\uBA54\uB77C\uAC00 \uB2E4 \uD558\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: You're up early. So am I. The hallway's better before dawn.
      textKo: "\uC77C\uCC0D \uC77C\uC5B4\uB098\uC168\uB124\uC694. \uC800\uB3C4\uC694.
        \uBCF5\uB3C4\uB294 \uB3D9\uD2B8\uAE30 \uC804\uC774 \uC81C\uC77C \uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Shutter. Mine. I got up three times. Kept feeling like I'd missed something.
      textKo: "\uC154\uD130\uC694. \uC81C \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC138 \uBC88 \uC77C\uC5B4\uB0AC\uC5B4\uC694.
        \uBB54\uAC00 \uB193\uCE5C \uAC83 \uAC19\uC740 \uAE30\uBD84\uC774 \uACC4\uC18D
        \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC11C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: shots
    labelEn: Ask what he photographed in the night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC5D0 \uBB34\uC5C7\uC744 \uCC0D\uC5C8\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Empty wall. End of the corridor. When I check the back of the camera,
        it isn't empty.
      textKo: "\uBE48 \uBCBD\uC774\uC694. \uBCF5\uB3C4 \uB05D. \uCE74\uBA54\uB77C
        \uB4B7\uBA74\uC73C\uB85C \uD655\uC778\uD558\uBA74, \uBE44\uC5B4 \uC788\uC9C0\uAC00
        \uC54A\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: who
    labelEn: Ask who's in the pictures
    labelKo: "\uC0AC\uC9C4\uC5D0 \uB204\uAC00 \uC788\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I don't know them. They're always facing away. And there's one more
        every time I look.
      textKo: "\uBAA8\uB974\uB294 \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB298 \uB4F1\uC744
        \uB3CC\uB9AC\uACE0 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694. \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uBCFC \uB54C\uB9C8\uB2E4
        \uD55C \uBA85\uC529 \uB298\uC5B4 \uC788\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Good evening. I won't keep you long - a room, two or three nights.
      textKo: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC2ED\uB2C8\uAE4C. \uC624\uB798 \uBD99\uC7A1\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4 - \uBC29 \uD558\uB098, \uC774\uC0BC \uC77C\uC774\uBA74
        \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The end room, if it's free. I like to be where the hall stops.
      textKo: "\uAC00\uB2A5\uD558\uBA74 \uB05D\uBC29\uC73C\uB85C\uC694. \uBCF5\uB3C4\uAC00
        \uB05D\uB098\uB294 \uC790\uB9AC\uAC00 \uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless this house. It has seen a great deal, hasn't it.
      textKo: "\uC774 \uC9D1\uC5D0 \uBCF5\uC774 \uC788\uAE30\uB97C. \uC774 \uC9D1\uB3C4
        \uCC38 \uB9CE\uC740 \uAC78 \uBCF4\uC558\uACA0\uC9C0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: name
    labelEn: Ask their name
    labelKo: "\uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Father. That will do. The rest is on the diocese card.
      textKo: "\uC2E0\uBD80\uB77C\uACE0 \uD558\uC2DC\uBA74 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB098\uBA38\uC9C0\uB294
        \uAD50\uAD6C \uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC5D0 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: purpose
    labelEn: Ask why he's in town
    labelKo: "\uC774 \uB3D9\uB124\uC5D0 \uC628 \uC774\uC720\uB97C \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: To see one of the flock off. The service is the day after tomorrow.
        Someone should sit with them until then.
      textKo: "\uC591 \uD55C \uB9C8\uB9AC\uB97C \uBC30\uC6C5\uD558\uB7EC\uC694. \uC7A5\uB840\uB294
        \uBAA8\uB808\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB54C\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uB204\uAD70\uAC00\uB294
        \uACC1\uC744 \uC9C0\uCF1C\uC57C\uC9C0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: room
    labelEn: Ask about the end-room request
    labelKo: "\uB05D\uBC29\uC744 \uC6D0\uD558\uB294 \uC774\uC720\uB97C \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fewer walls for sound to carry through. I pray aloud. It disturbs people.
      textKo: "\uC18C\uB9AC\uAC00 \uC0C8\uC5B4 \uB098\uAC08 \uBCBD\uC774 \uC801\uC5B4\uC11C\uC694.
        \uC800\uB294 \uC18C\uB9AC \uB0B4\uC5B4 \uAE30\uB3C4\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC774
        \uBD88\uD3B8\uD574\uD558\uC9C0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how many nights
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Three. Unless they hold the service longer. These things run their
        own time.
      textKo: "\uC0AC\uD758\uC774\uC694. \uC7A5\uB840\uAC00 \uAE38\uC5B4\uC9C0\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4\uBA74\uC694. \uC774\uB7F0 \uC77C\uC740 \uC81C \uB098\uB984\uC758
        \uC2DC\uAC04\uC774 \uC788\uC5B4\uC11C."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Ask for payment up front
      labelKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Let the church settle it
      labelKo: "\uAD50\uD68C\uAC00 \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_trust
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front. Of course. The Lord's money spends the same.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC774\uC694. \uADF8\uB7FC\uC694. \uC8FC\uB2D8\uC758 \uB3C8\uB3C4
        \uC4F0\uC774\uB294 \uAC74 \uB611\uAC19\uC9C0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_trust
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The parish will send it. Put it in whatever box you keep for such things.
      textKo: "\uAD50\uAD6C\uC5D0\uC11C \uBCF4\uB0BC \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB7F0
        \uAC78 \uB123\uC5B4\uB450\uB294 \uD568\uC774 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74 \uAC70\uAE30\uC5D0
        \uB123\uC5B4\uB450\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Leave the room as it is. Once I've knelt in it, it is a place of prayer.
        It should not be tidied.
      textKo: "\uBC29\uC740 \uADF8\uB300\uB85C \uB450\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624. \uC81C\uAC00
        \uD55C \uBC88 \uBB34\uB98E \uAFC7\uC740 \uBC29\uC740 \uAE30\uB3C4\uD558\uB294
        \uC790\uB9AC\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC815\uB9AC\uD560 \uACF3\uC774 \uC544\uB2C8\uC5D0\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Agree to leave it
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB7EC\uAE30\uB85C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    - labelEn: Say it will be cleaned anyway
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uCCAD\uC18C\uD55C\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You would be surprised how much a room remembers.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBC29\uC774 \uC5BC\uB9C8\uB098 \uB9CE\uC740
        \uAC78 \uAE30\uC5B5\uD558\uB294\uC9C0 \uC544\uC2DC\uBA74 \uB180\uB77C\uC2E4
        \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Then do it in daylight, and say nothing while you work. Some of what's
        in there is listening.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uB0AE\uC5D0 \uD558\uC2DC\uACE0, \uC77C\uD558\uB294 \uB3D9\uC548
        \uC544\uBB34 \uB9D0\uB3C4 \uB9C8\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624. \uADF8 \uC548\uC5D0 \uC788\uB294
        \uAC83 \uC911\uC5D4 \uADC0\uB97C \uAE30\uC6B8\uC774\uB294 \uAC83\uB3C4 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: You would send a priest back onto the road at night?
      textKo: "\uD55C\uBC24\uC911\uC5D0 \uC2E0\uBD80\uB97C \uAE38\uBC14\uB2E5\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B4\uC2DC\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I have slept in churches with no roof. I only ask because someone in
        this town needs me tomorrow.
      textKo: "\uC9C0\uBD95\uB3C4 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC131\uB2F9\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uC790\uBD24\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uB2E4\uB9CC \uB0B4\uC77C \uC774 \uB3D9\uB124\uC5D0 \uC800\uB97C \uD544\uC694\uB85C
        \uD558\uB294 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uC788\uC5B4\uC11C \uCCAD\uD558\uB294 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uD638\uD558\uAC8C \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Let him stay
      labelKo: "\uBB35\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Then I'll keep my vigil in the lot. God is not particular about walls.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uC8FC\uCC28\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C \uBC24\uC744 \uC0C8\uC6B0\uC9C0\uC694.
        \uD558\uB290\uB2D8\uC740 \uBCBD\uC744 \uAC00\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC73C\uC2ED\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you. Sleep without fear tonight - I'll be awake for both of us.
      textKo: "\uBCF5 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624. \uC624\uB298 \uBC24\uC740 \uB450\uB824\uC6C0
        \uC5C6\uC774 \uC8FC\uBB34\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694 - \uC6B0\uB9AC \uB458 \uBAAB\uC73C\uB85C
        \uC81C\uAC00 \uAE68\uC5B4 \uC788\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: There. The full stay. Now show me to the end of the hall.
      textKo: "\uC5EC\uAE30\uC694. \uC219\uBC15\uBE44 \uC804\uC561\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uBCF5\uB3C4 \uB05D\uC73C\uB85C \uC548\uB0B4\uD574 \uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you. Sleep without fear tonight - I'll be awake for both of us.
      textKo: "\uBCF5 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624. \uC624\uB298 \uBC24\uC740 \uB450\uB824\uC6C0
        \uC5C6\uC774 \uC8FC\uBB34\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694 - \uC6B0\uB9AC \uB458 \uBAAB\uC73C\uB85C
        \uC81C\uAC00 \uAE68\uC5B4 \uC788\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Come in, come in. I was only reading. I'm always only reading, at this
        hour.
      textKo: "\uB4E4\uC5B4\uC624\uC138\uC694, \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC624\uC138\uC694. \uADF8\uB0E5
        \uC77D\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC5D4 \uB298
        \uADF8\uB0E5 \uC77D\uACE0 \uC788\uC9C0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: That was me. Prayer, most of it. Toward the end I was answering someone.
        Habit.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC74 \uC800\uC600\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB300\uBD80\uBD84 \uAE30\uB3C4\uACE0\uC694.
        \uB05D \uBB34\uB835\uC5D4 \uB204\uAD70\uAC00\uC5D0\uAC8C \uB300\uB2F5\uC744
        \uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694. \uC2B5\uAD00\uC774\uC9C0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: room
    labelEn: Ask who left this room before him
    labelKo: "\uC804\uC5D0 \uC774 \uBC29\uC744 \uB5A0\uB09C \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uB204\uAD6C\uC778\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Someone did. I can tell. The air in a room hangs different after. This
        one hangs very heavy.
      textKo: "\uB204\uAD70\uAC00 \uB5A0\uB0AC\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC555\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uADF8 \uB4A4\uC5D4 \uBC29 \uACF5\uAE30\uAC00 \uB2E4\uB974\uAC8C \uAC78\uB824
        \uC788\uC5B4\uC694. \uC774 \uBC29\uC740 \uC544\uC8FC \uBB34\uAC81\uAC8C \uAC78\uB824
        \uC788\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: doors
    labelEn: Ask why he touches every door in the hall
    labelKo: "\uBCF5\uB3C4\uC758 \uBB38\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uC190\uC744 \uB300\uB294 \uC774\uC720\uB97C
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Marking them. So that whatever walks the hall tonight knows which rooms
        are spoken for.
      textKo: "\uD45C\uC2DC\uD558\uB294 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC624\uB298 \uBC24 \uBCF5\uB3C4\uB97C
        \uAC77\uB294 \uAC8C \uBB34\uC5C7\uC774\uB4E0, \uC5B4\uB290 \uBC29\uC774 \uC774\uBBF8
        \uC784\uC790\uAC00 \uC788\uB294\uC9C0 \uC54C\uB3C4\uB85D."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: id
    labelEn: Ask for identification
    labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: License and hauling permit. Both current.
      textKo: "\uBA74\uD5C8\uD558\uACE0 \uC6B4\uC1A1 \uD5C8\uAC00\uC99D\uC774\uC694.
        \uB458 \uB2E4 \uC720\uD6A8\uD558\uACE0."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Look at the ID
      labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: id_show
    - labelEn: Never mind
      labelKo: "\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 6
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: id_show
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Address on there's two states back. I move around.
      textKo: "\uAC70\uAE30 \uC8FC\uC18C\uB294 \uB450 \uC8FC \uC804 \uAC70\uC694.
        \uC5EC\uAE30\uC800\uAE30 \uB2E4\uB2C8\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: id
    labelEn: Ask for identification
    labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mine's here. Don't ask him for his - he's four.
      textKo: "\uC81C \uAC74 \uC5EC\uAE30\uC694. \uC560\uD55C\uD14C\uB294 \uBB3B\uC9C0
        \uB9C8\uC138\uC694, \uB124 \uC0B4\uC774\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Look at the ID
      labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: id_show
    - labelEn: Never mind
      labelKo: "\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 7
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: id_show
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just me on it. He's not registered anywhere yet.
      textKo: "\uC800 \uD558\uB098\uB9CC \uC788\uC5B4\uC694. \uC560\uB294 \uC544\uC9C1
        \uC5B4\uB514\uC5D0\uB3C4 \uB4F1\uB85D\uC774 \uC548 \uB3FC\uC11C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: id
    labelEn: Ask for identification
    labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Press card's expired. State ID's fine, though.
      textKo: "\uAE30\uC790\uC99D\uC740 \uB9CC\uB8CC\uB410\uACE0\uC694. \uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC740
        \uBA40\uCA61\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Look at the ID
      labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: id_show
    - labelEn: Never mind
      labelKo: "\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 8
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: id_show
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The address is a P.O. box. I'm not home much.
      textKo: "\uC8FC\uC18C\uB294 \uC0AC\uC11C\uD568\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. \uC9D1\uC5D0
        \uC798 \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC11C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: id
    labelEn: Ask for identification
    labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The diocese issued it. A long time ago now.
      textKo: "\uAD50\uAD6C\uC5D0\uC11C \uBC1C\uAE09\uD55C \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC774\uC81C\uB294
        \uAF64 \uC624\uB798\uB410\uC9C0\uB9CC\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Look at the ID
      labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: id_show
    - labelEn: Never mind
      labelKo: "\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 9
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: id_show
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The parish on there closed years ago. I never updated it.
      textKo: "\uAC70\uAE30 \uC801\uD78C \uAD50\uAD6C\uB294 \uBA87 \uB144 \uC804\uC5D0
        \uBB38\uC744 \uB2EB\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uAC31\uC2E0\uC744 \uC548 \uD588\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Evening. Got a room for one night?
      textKo: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694. \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24 \uBB35\uC744 \uBC29
        \uD558\uB098 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just the one night. I'm back on the road at first light.
      textKo: "\uB531 \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uBA74 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB0A0 \uBC1D\uC73C\uBA74
        \uBC14\uB85C \uB5A0\uB0A0 \uAC70\uB77C\uC11C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Been walking since dawn. I'm done in.
      textKo: "\uC0C8\uBCBD\uBD80\uD130 \uACC4\uC18D \uAC78\uC5C8\uB354\uB2C8 \uC644\uC804\uD788
        \uB179\uCD08\uAC00 \uB410\uB124\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: name
    labelEn: Ask their name
    labelKo: "\uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just call me a traveler. Names don't buy much out here.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB098\uADF8\uB124\uB77C\uACE0 \uD558\uC8E0. \uC774\uB7F0
        \uB370\uC11C \uC774\uB984\uC774 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC18C\uC6A9\uC774\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: where
    labelEn: Ask where they're headed
    labelKo: "\uC5B4\uB514\uB85C \uAC00\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Somewhere the road stops. You know any place like that?
      textKo: "\uAE38\uC774 \uB05D\uB098\uB294 \uACF3 \uC5B4\uB514\uCBE4\uC774\uC694.
        \uADF8\uB7F0 \uB370\uB97C \uC544\uC2ED\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices:
    - labelEn: I wish I did
      labelKo: "\uC800\uB3C4 \uC54C\uBA74 \uC88B\uACA0\uB124\uC694"
      goToNode: where_a
    - labelEn: Just take the room
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uBC29 \uC4F0\uC138\uC694"
      goToNode: where_b
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: where_a
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Yeah. Figured as much.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB807\uACA0\uC8E0. \uADF8\uB7F4 \uC904 \uC54C\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: where_b
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fair enough. Lead the way.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC548\uB0B4\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Confirm how long they're staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night. Same as I said. I won't be a bother past dawn.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uC694. \uC544\uAE4C \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB9B0
        \uADF8\uB300\uB85C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB0A0 \uBC1D\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0 \uC870\uC6A9\uD788
        \uB098\uAC08 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Take one night up front
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58\uB97C \uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Settle up when they leave
      labelKo: "\uB098\uAC08 \uB54C \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uAE30\uB85C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_trust
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front. Alright. I'll have it ready for you.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uB85C\uC694. \uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC900\uBE44\uD574
        \uB450\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_trust
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Appreciated. You'll get it at the door.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB098\uAC08 \uB54C \uB4DC\uB9AC\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Housekeeping? Whatever's easiest for you.
      textKo: "\uCCAD\uC18C\uC694? \uD3B8\uD558\uC2E4 \uB300\uB85C \uD558\uC138\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Tidy the room each morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uBC29\uC744 \uC815\uB9AC\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Only go in when he asks
      labelKo: "\uBD80\uB97C \uB54C\uB9CC \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Suits me. One less thing to think about.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uC88B\uC8E0. \uC2E0\uACBD \uC4F8 \uC77C \uD558\uB098
        \uC904\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fine. I'll knock if I need anything.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD544\uC694\uD558\uBA74 \uBD80\uB974\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No room? After all that walking?
      textKo: "\uBC29\uC774 \uC5C6\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694? \uC774\uB807\uAC8C \uAC78\uC5B4\uC654\uB294\uB370\uC694?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I won't be trouble. Gone by first light.
      textKo: "\uD3D0 \uB07C\uCE58\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC744\uAC8C\uC694. \uB0A0 \uBC1D\uC73C\uBA74
        \uBC14\uB85C \uB5A0\uB098\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uD638\uD558\uAC8C \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Reconsider
      labelKo: "\uB2E4\uC2DC \uC0DD\uAC01\uD574 \uBCF8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Fine. I've slept in worse than a ditch.
      textKo: "...\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB3C4\uB791\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4
        \uC790\uBD24\uB294\uAC78\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You won't hear a sound from me.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC18C\uB9AC \uD558\uB098 \uC548 \uB0B4\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Here - the night, paid in full.
      textKo: "\uC5EC\uAE30 - \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58, \uC120\uBD88\uAE08\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC804\uC561\uC774\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You won't hear a sound from me.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC18C\uB9AC \uD558\uB098 \uC548 \uB0B4\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: What do you want at this hour?
      textKo: "\uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC5D0 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC77C\uC774\uC2ED\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Noise? I was asleep the whole time.
      textKo: "\uC18C\uC74C\uC774\uC694? \uC800\uB294 \uBC24\uC0C8 \uC790\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uB294\uB370\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: heard
    labelEn: Ask if he heard anything
    labelKo: "\uBB54\uAC00 \uB4E4\uC740 \uAC8C \uC5C6\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Wind on the window. A door down the hall, once. Then nothing.
      textKo: "\uCC3D\uBB38\uC5D0 \uBC14\uB78C \uC18C\uB9AC. \uBCF5\uB3C4 \uC800\uCABD\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBB38\uC18C\uB9AC \uD55C \uBC88. \uADF8\uB7EC\uACE4 \uC870\uC6A9\uD588\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: leaving
    labelEn: Ask when he's leaving
    labelKo: "\uC5B8\uC81C \uB5A0\uB0A0 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The moment you let me. I've a long way to go.
      textKo: "\uBCF4\uB0B4\uC8FC\uC2DC\uB294 \uB300\uB85C \uBC14\uB85C\uC694. \uAC08
        \uAE38\uC774 \uBA38\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Ah - yes. Hello. A room. Please. Just the one.
      textKo: "\uC544, \uB124. \uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694. \uBC29... \uBC29 \uD558\uB098
        \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD558\uB098\uBA74 \uB3FC\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two nights. Maybe three. I'll know more tomorrow. Probably.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0\uC774\uC694. \uC0AC\uD758\uC77C \uC218\uB3C4 \uC788\uACE0\uC694.
        \uB0B4\uC77C\uC774\uBA74 \uD655\uC2E4\uD574\uC9C8 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC544\uB9C8\uB3C4\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Long day. Very long. You have no idea.
      textKo: "\uAE34 \uD558\uB8E8\uC600\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC544\uC8FC \uAE38\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694.
        \uB9D0\uB3C4 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh - and could someone tidy the room in the mornings? Just... leave
        the case where it is.
      textKo: "\uC544, \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 - \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uBC29 \uC880 \uC815\uB9AC\uD574
        \uC8FC\uC2E4 \uC218 \uC788\uC744\uAE4C\uC694? \uAC00\uBC29\uC740... \uADF8\uB0E5
        \uADF8 \uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uB450\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: case
    labelEn: Ask about his briefcase
    labelKo: "\uC11C\uB958\uAC00\uBC29\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Work files. Contracts, mostly. Nothing you'd want. Nothing at all.
      textKo: "\uC5C5\uBB34 \uC790\uB8CC\uC608\uC694. \uB300\uBD80\uBD84 \uACC4\uC57D\uC11C\uACE0\uC694.
        \uD0D0\uB098\uC2E4 \uBB3C\uAC74\uC740 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC815\uB9D0
        \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: shaking
    labelEn: Ask why he's shaking
    labelKo: "\uC65C \uB5A8\uACE0 \uC788\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Cold out. That's all. Just the cold.
      textKo: "\uBC16\uC774 \uCD94\uC6CC\uC11C \uADF8\uB798\uC694. \uADF8\uAC8C \uB2E4\uC608\uC694.
        \uADF8\uB0E5 \uCD94\uC704 \uD0D3\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Let it go
      labelKo: "\uB118\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    - labelEn: Press him
      labelKo: "\uCD94\uAD81\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: shaking_press
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: shaking_press
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I said it's the cold! Are we done here?
      textKo: "\uCD94\uC704 \uB54C\uBB38\uC774\uB77C\uACE0 \uD588\uC796\uC544\uC694!
        \uC774\uC81C \uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how long he's staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60\uC774\uB098 \uC788\uC744 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two. Definitely two. ...Unless the roads stay bad. Then three. Four
        at the very most.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0\uC774\uC694. \uD655\uC2E4\uD788 \uC774\uD2C0\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        ...\uAE38 \uC0AC\uC815\uC774 \uACC4\uC18D \uC548 \uC88B\uC73C\uBA74 \uC0AC\uD758.
        \uAE38\uC5B4\uC57C \uB098\uD758\uC774\uACE0\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Ask for payment up front
      labelKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uACA0\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay_refused
    - labelEn: Say he can settle later
      labelKo: "\uB5A0\uB0A0 \uB54C \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uC790\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_later
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay_refused
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front? I - not now. Please. When I leave. You'll have all of it,
        I promise.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC774\uC694? \uC800 - \uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uC880. \uC81C\uBC1C\uC694.
        \uB098\uAC08 \uB54C\uC694. \uC804\uBD80 \uB2E4 \uB4DC\uB9B4\uAC8C\uC694,
        \uC57D\uC18D\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_later
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: When I leave. Good. Better. Much better, actually.
      textKo: "\uB098\uAC08 \uB54C\uC694. \uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uAC8C
        \uB0AB\uC8E0. \uD6E8\uC52C \uB0AB\uB124\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mornings would be best. I'm usually out by then. Usually.
      textKo: "\uC544\uCE68\uC774 \uC81C\uC77C \uC88B\uC544\uC694. \uADF8\uB550 \uBCF4\uD1B5
        \uB098\uAC00 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694. \uBCF4\uD1B5\uC740\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Clean every morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uCCAD\uC18C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Leave the room alone
      labelKo: "\uBC29\uC740 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. Just - the briefcase. Don't move the briefcase.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB0E5 - \uC11C\uB958\uAC00\uBC29\uB9CC\uC694.
        \uC11C\uB958\uAC00\uBC29\uC740 \uC62E\uAE30\uC9C0 \uB9D0\uC544 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Actually, yes. Better. I'll manage it myself.
      textKo: "...\uC0AC\uC2E4, \uB124. \uADF8\uAC8C \uB0AB\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694. \uC81C\uAC00
        \uC54C\uC544\uC11C \uD558\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No? Please. I can pay double. Double, for one room.
      textKo: "\uC548 \uB41C\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694? \uC81C\uBC1C\uC694. \uB450 \uBC30\uB85C
        \uB0B4\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBC29 \uD558\uB098\uC5D0 \uB450 \uBC30\uB85C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Where else is open? Nowhere. You know that.
      textKo: "\uB2E4\uB978 \uB370\uAC00 \uC5B4\uB514 \uC5F4\uC5C8\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694?
        \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694. \uC544\uC2DC\uC796\uC544\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Take the double
      labelKo: "\uB450 \uBC30\uB97C \uBC1B\uACE0 \uB4E4\uC778\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_double_accept
    - labelEn: Let him stay
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uBC1B\uC544\uC900\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_double_accept
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Double. Yes. Thank you - thank you. Here - take it.
      textKo: "\uB450 \uBC30\uC694. \uB124. \uAC10\uC0AC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4 - \uAC10\uC0AC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC5EC\uAE30 - \uBC1B\uC73C\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: This is a mistake. You'll see.
      textKo: "\uC774\uAC74 \uC2E4\uC218\uC608\uC694. \uB450\uACE0 \uBCF4\uC138\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fine. FINE. I'm going.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uC558\uC5B4\uC694. \uC54C\uC558\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694. \uAC11\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh thank you. You won't even know I'm here.
      textKo: "\uC544, \uAC10\uC0AC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC788\uB294 \uC904\uB3C4
        \uBAA8\uB974\uC2E4 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Wh- who is it? It's the middle of the night.
      textKo: "\uB204, \uB204\uAD6C\uC138\uC694? \uC9C0\uAE08 \uD55C\uBC24\uC911\uC778\uB370\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Oh. It's you. I didn't do anything. I've been in my room the whole
        time.
      textKo: "...\uC544. \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774\uAD70\uC694. \uC800 \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4
        \uC548 \uD588\uC5B4\uC694. \uACC4\uC18D \uBC29\uC5D0\uB9CC \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Noise? No. I didn't hear anything. I was asleep. Mostly.
      textKo: "\uC18C\uC74C\uC774\uC694? \uC544\uB2C8\uC694. \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4
        \uBABB \uB4E4\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694. \uC790\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694. \uAC70\uC758\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: night
    labelEn: Ask what he did all night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC0C8 \uBB58 \uD588\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Sorting papers. Re-sorting them. They have to go back in a certain
        order, or they- it doesn't matter. Why?
      textKo: "\uC11C\uB958 \uC815\uB9AC\uD558\uACE0. \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC815\uB9AC\uD558\uACE0.
        \uB531 \uC21C\uC11C\uB300\uB85C \uB123\uC5B4\uC57C \uC548 \uADF8\uB7EC\uBA74-
        \uC544\uBB34\uD2BC\uC694. \uC65C\uC694?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: seen
    labelEn: Ask if he saw anything
    labelKo: "\uC774\uC0C1\uD55C \uAC78 \uBABB \uBD24\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Through what window? The curtains stayed shut. They stay shut. Are
        we done here?
      textKo: "\uBB34\uC2A8 \uCC3D\uBB38\uC73C\uB85C\uC694? \uCEE4\uD2BC\uC740 \uACC4\uC18D
        \uCCD0\uB1A8\uC5B4\uC694. \uACC4\uC18D\uC694. \uC774\uC81C \uB410\uC8E0?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: You run this place? Hm. Explains the smell.
      textKo: "\uC5EC\uAE30 \uC8FC\uC778\uC774 \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774\uC57C? \uD760.
        \uC5B4\uCA50\uC9C0 \uB0C4\uC0C8\uAC00 \uB098\uB354\uB77C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A room. And be quick about it - I've wasted enough of my night on this
        road.
      textKo: "\uBC29 \uD558\uB098. \uBE68\uB9AC\uBE68\uB9AC \uD574 - \uC774 \uAE38\uBC14\uB2E5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBC24\uC0C8 \uC2DC\uAC04 \uBC84\uB838\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    - expression: 1
      textEn: And nobody sets foot in my room. No maid, not you. Understood?
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uB0B4 \uBC29\uC5D4 \uC544\uBB34\uB3C4 \uBC1C \uB4E4\uC774\uC9C0
        \uB9C8. \uCCAD\uC18C\uBD80\uB3C4, \uB108\uB3C4. \uC54C\uC544\uB4E4\uC5C8\uC5B4?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: wait
    labelEn: Ask him to wait a moment
    labelKo: "\uC7A0\uC2DC \uAE30\uB2E4\uB824 \uB2EC\uB77C\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Wait? You work here. I don't wait for the help.
      textKo: "\uAE30\uB2E4\uB824? \uB10C \uC5EC\uAE30 \uC9C1\uC6D0\uC774\uC796\uC544.
        \uB09C \uC885\uC5C5\uC6D0 \uB098\uBD80\uB7AD\uC774 \uC548 \uAE30\uB2E4\uB824."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: id
    labelEn: Ask for identification
    labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Identification. In a place like this. That's almost funny.
      textKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D. \uC774\uB534 \uB370\uC11C. \uC6C3\uAE30\uC9C0\uB3C4
        \uC54A\uB294\uAD70."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Insist on ID
      labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uACC4\uC18D \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: id_show
    - labelEn: Wave him through
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB4E4\uC5EC\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: id_show
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: ...There. Take a good look. Try not to move your lips when you read
        it.
      textKo: "...\uC790. \uC2E4\uCEF7 \uBD10. \uAE00 \uC77D\uC744 \uB54C \uC785\uC220
        \uC880 \uC548 \uC6C0\uC9C1\uC774\uBA74 \uC88B\uACA0\uB294\uB370."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how many nights
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two nights. Maybe three. You'll find out when I tell you.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0. \uC0AC\uD758\uC77C \uC218\uB3C4 \uC788\uACE0. \uB0B4\uAC00
        \uB9D0\uD574\uC8FC\uBA74 \uADF8\uB54C \uC54C\uACA0\uC9C0."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Demand payment up front
      labelKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Let it slide
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB118\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_skip
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Up front. From me. That's adorable. ...Fine. You'll get it. Now move.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88. \uB098\uD55C\uD14C. \uADC0\uC5FD\uAD70. ...\uC88B\uC544.
        \uC8FC\uC9C0. \uBE68\uB9AC \uC6C0\uC9C1\uC774\uAE30\uB098 \uD574."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_skip
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Smart. You learn fast, for someone in your position.
      textKo: "\uB611\uB611\uD558\uB124. \uADF8 \uC8FC\uC81C\uC5D0 \uB208\uCE58\uB294
        \uC788\uACE0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I said no. Are you slow? The door stays shut. I clean up after myself.
      textKo: "\uC548 \uB41C\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD588\uC796\uC544. \uBA38\uB9AC\uAC00 \uB098\uBE60?
        \uBB38\uC740 \uC7A0\uAC00 \uB46C. \uB0B4 \uB4A4\uCE58\uB2E4\uAEBC\uB9AC\uB294
        \uB0B4\uAC00 \uD574."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Excuse me?
      textKo: "\uBB50\uB77C\uACE0?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: You're turning ME away. From a roadside dump like this.
      textKo: "\uB0A0 \uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4\uACE0. \uC774\uB534 \uAE38\uAC00
        \uC4F0\uB808\uAE30\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Stand your ground
      labelKo: "\uBB3C\uB7EC\uC11C\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Back down
      labelKo: "\uBB3C\uB7EC\uC120\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: You'll wish you hadn't. People like you always do.
      textKo: "\uD6C4\uD68C\uD558\uAC8C \uB420 \uAC70\uC57C. \uB108 \uAC19\uC740
        \uAC83\uB4E4\uC740 \uAF2D \uADF8\uB7EC\uB354\uB77C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Finally. Try to be less useless tomorrow.
      textKo: "\uB4DC\uB514\uC5B4. \uB0B4\uC77C\uC740 \uC880 \uB35C \uAD7C\uB728\uB4E0\uAC00."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: There's your money. The whole stay, up front, since you had to make
        it weird.
      textKo: "\uB3C8 \uC5EC\uAE30 \uC788\uB2E4. \uC219\uBC15\uBE44 \uC804\uC561,
        \uC120\uBD88\uB85C. \uAF2D \uC720\uB09C\uC744 \uB5A8\uC5B4\uC57C \uD588\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Finally. Try to be less useless tomorrow.
      textKo: "\uB4DC\uB514\uC5B4. \uB0B4\uC77C\uC740 \uC880 \uB35C \uAD7C\uB728\uB4E0\uAC00."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Do you have any idea what time it is? You're pounding on my door.
      textKo: "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uBA87 \uC2E0 \uC904\uC774\uB098 \uC54C\uC544? \uB0B4
        \uBC29 \uBB38\uC744 \uB450\uB4DC\uB824\uB300\uACE0 \uC788\uC796\uC544."
    - expression: 1
      textEn: This had better be good.
      textKo: "\uC6A9\uAC74\uC774 \uB300\uB2E8\uD574\uC57C \uD560 \uAC70\uC57C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: The only noise in this dump is you. Right now. Deal with it yourself.
      textKo: "\uC774 \uC4F0\uB808\uAE30\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C \uC2DC\uB044\uB7EC\uC6B4
        \uAC74 \uB108\uBFD0\uC774\uC57C. \uC9C0\uAE08 \uC774 \uC21C\uAC04. \uC54C\uC544\uC11C
        \uCC98\uB9AC\uD574."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: night
    labelEn: Ask what he did all night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC0C8 \uBB58 \uD588\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I slept. Or tried to. Hard to rest in a place that lets anyone wander
        the halls.
      textKo: "\uC7A4\uC5B4. \uC790\uB824\uACE0\uB294 \uD588\uC9C0. \uC544\uBB34\uB098
        \uBCF5\uB3C4\uB97C \uC5B4\uC2AC\uB801\uB300\uB294 \uB370\uC11C \uC7A0\uC774
        \uC624\uACA0\uB0D0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: halls
    labelEn: Ask who was in the halls
    labelKo: "\uBCF5\uB3C4\uC5D0 \uB204\uAC00 \uC788\uC5C8\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: How would I know? I wasn't standing guard. That's supposed to be your
        job.
      textKo: "\uB0B4\uAC00 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uC54C\uC544? \uBCF4\uCD08 \uC11C\uACE0
        \uC788\uB358 \uAC83\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0. \uADF8\uAC8C \uB124 \uC77C
        \uC544\uB2C8\uC5C8\uB0D0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A room. Away from the road if you have one.
      textKo: "\uBC29 \uD558\uB098\uC694. \uAC00\uB2A5\uD558\uBA74 \uAE38\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBA3C \uCABD\uC73C\uB85C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I don't know how many nights yet. Is that a problem?
      textKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0\uB294 \uC544\uC9C1 \uBAB0\uB77C\uC694.
        \uADF8\uAC8C \uBB38\uC81C\uAC00 \uB418\uB098\uC694?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No housekeeping, please. I'll see to the room myself.
      textKo: "\uCCAD\uC18C\uB294 \uC548 \uD558\uC154\uB3C4 \uB3FC\uC694. \uBC29\uC740
        \uC81C\uAC00 \uC54C\uC544\uC11C \uD560\uAC8C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: road
    labelEn: Ask why away from the road
    labelKo: "\uC65C \uAE38\uC5D0\uC11C \uBA3C \uCABD\uC778\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I sleep lighter than most.
      textKo: "\uC81C\uAC00 \uC7A0\uADC0\uAC00 \uC880 \uBC1D\uC740 \uD3B8\uC774\uB77C\uC11C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: alone
    labelEn: Ask if she's travelling alone
    labelKo: "\uD63C\uC790 \uC5EC\uD589 \uC911\uC778\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Is that a requirement?
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uC870\uAC74\uC778\uAC00\uC694?"
    choices:
    - labelEn: Ask gently
      labelKo: "\uBD80\uB4DC\uB7FD\uAC8C \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: alone_soft
    - labelEn: Ask straight
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uB3C4\uC9C1\uC785\uC801\uC73C\uB85C \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: alone_hard
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: alone_soft
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Yes. Alone.
      textKo: "...\uB124. \uD63C\uC790\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: alone_hard
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: That's my business. Not yours.
      textKo: "\uC81C \uC77C\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774 \uC0C1\uAD00\uD560
        \uBC14 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how long she'll stay
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uC788\uC744 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night for certain. After that, I'll tell you each morning.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC740 \uD655\uC2E4\uD574\uC694. \uADF8\uB2E4\uC74C\uC740
        \uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB9B4\uAC8C\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Charge one night at a time
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8E8\uCE58\uC529\uB9CC \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_ok
    - labelEn: Demand an exact date
      labelKo: "\uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB0A0\uC9DC\uB97C \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_press
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_ok
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. That's easier for both of us.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9C8\uC6CC\uC694. \uADF8\uAC8C \uC11C\uB85C \uD3B8\uD558\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_press
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I said I don't know. Pushing me won't change that.
      textKo: "\uBAA8\uB978\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD588\uC796\uC544\uC694. \uBAB0\uC544\uBD99\uC5EC\uB3C4
        \uC18C\uC6A9\uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I already told you. Leave the room to me.
      textKo: "\uC774\uBBF8 \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB838\uC796\uC544\uC694. \uBC29\uC740
        \uC800\uD55C\uD14C \uB9E1\uAE30\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I see.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB807\uAD70\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_final
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I'll find somewhere. I always do.
      textKo: "\uC5B4\uB514\uB4E0 \uCC3E\uACA0\uC8E0. \uB298 \uADF8\uB798\uC654\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Good. Don't knock after dark.
      textKo: "\uC88B\uC544\uC694. \uC5B4\uB450\uC6CC\uC9C4 \uB4A4\uC5D4 \uBB38 \uB450\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0
        \uB9C8\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: refuse
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...I told you not to knock after dark. Go back. We'll talk in the morning.
      textKo: "...\uC5B4\uB450\uC6CC\uC9C0\uBA74 \uB450\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uB9D0\uB7AC\uC8E0.
        \uB3CC\uC544\uAC00\uC138\uC694. \uC598\uAE30\uB294 \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uD558\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Evening evening! Cold one out there tonight isn't it?
      textKo: "\uBC18\uAC11\uC18C, \uBC18\uAC11\uC18C! \uC624\uB298 \uBC24 \uBC14\uAE65\uC774
        \uAF64 \uCDA5\uAD6C\uB824."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Room for an old man's bones?
      textKo: "\uC774 \uB299\uC740 \uBAB8 \uB260 \uBC29 \uD558\uB098 \uC788\uACA0\uC18C?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I'll be under your roof a week or so - these knees don't travel like
        they used to.
      textKo: "\uD55C \uC77C\uC8FC\uC77C\uCBE4 \uC2E0\uC138 \uC880 \uC9C0\uB824 \uD558\uC624.
        \uBB34\uB98E\uC774 \uC608\uC804 \uAC19\uC9C8 \uC54A\uC544\uC11C \uB9D0\uC774\uC624."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: If it's no trouble - a quick tidy each morning would be a kindness.
        These hands don't do much anymore.
      textKo: "\uAD1C\uCC2E\uC73C\uC2DC\uBA74 - \uC544\uCE68\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uC7A0\uAE50
        \uC815\uB9AC\uD574 \uC8FC\uC2DC\uBA74 \uACE0\uB9D9\uACA0\uC18C. \uC774 \uC190\uC774
        \uC608\uC804 \uAC19\uC9C8 \uC54A\uC544\uC11C \uB9D0\uC774\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: trip
    labelEn: Ask about his journey
    labelKo: "\uC5EC\uC815\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh it's a long story. Which part do you want?
      textKo: "\uC544, \uAE34 \uC774\uC57C\uAE30\uB77C\uC624. \uC5B4\uB290 \uB300\uBAA9\uC774
        \uAD81\uAE08\uD558\uC2DC\uC624?"
    choices:
    - labelEn: The beginning
      labelKo: "\uCC98\uC74C\uBD80\uD130 \uB4E3\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: trip_begin
    - labelEn: The short version
      labelKo: "\uC9E7\uAC8C \uB4E3\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: trip_short
    - labelEn: Skip it
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB9CC \uB4E3\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: trip_begin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: It started forty years back in a town that isn't on the maps anymore...
      textKo: "\uC0AC\uC2ED \uB144 \uC804, \uC774\uC81C\uB294 \uC9C0\uB3C4\uC5D0\uB3C4
        \uC5C6\uB294 \uB9C8\uC744\uC5D0\uC11C \uC2DC\uC791\uB410\uB2E4\uC624..."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: trip_short
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Visiting family. Or what's left of them.
      textKo: "\uAC00\uC871\uC744 \uBCF4\uB7EC \uAC00\uB294 \uAE38\uC774\uC624. \uB0A8\uC740
        \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uC5BC\uB9C8 \uC5C6\uC9C0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: weather
    labelEn: Ask about the weather
    labelKo: "\uB0A0\uC528\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Storm's coming. Mark my words. Sky goes green first.
      textKo: "\uD3ED\uD48D\uC774 \uC624\uACE0 \uC788\uC18C. \uB0B4 \uB9D0 \uBA85\uC2EC\uD558\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uD558\uB298\uBD80\uD130 \uCD08\uB85D\uBE5B\uC73C\uB85C \uBB3C\uB4E0\uB2E4\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how many nights
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60\uC774\uB098 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A week ought to do it. Though if that storm settles in - well, who's
        to say.
      textKo: "\uC77C\uC8FC\uC77C\uC774\uBA74 \uB418\uC9C0 \uC2F6\uC18C. \uBB50,
        \uADF8 \uD3ED\uD48D\uC774 \uB20C\uB7EC\uC549\uC73C\uBA74 - \uAE00\uC384,
        \uBAA8\uB97C \uC77C\uC774\uC624\uB9CC."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Book the whole week
      labelKo: "\uC77C\uC8FC\uC77C\uCE58\uB97C \uD55C \uBC88\uC5D0 \uC801\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_week
    - labelEn: Charge him day by day
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8E8\uC529 \uBC1B\uACA0\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_daily
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_week
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Kind of you. Settles an old mind.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uAD6C\uB824. \uB299\uC740\uC774 \uB9C8\uC74C\uC774 \uB193\uC774\uB294\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_daily
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: That suits me fine. Day by day - that's about my speed now.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC83\uB3C4 \uC88B\uC18C. \uD558\uB8E8\uD558\uB8E8 - \uC694\uC998
        \uB0B4 \uAC78\uC74C\uAC78\uC774\uAC00 \uB531 \uADF8\uB807\uB2E4\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: need
    labelEn: Ask if he needs anything
    labelKo: "\uD544\uC694\uD55C \uAC8C \uC788\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Kind of you to ask.
      textKo: "\uBB3C\uC5B4\uBD10 \uC8FC\uB2C8 \uACE0\uB9D9\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Offer an extra blanket
      labelKo: "\uB2F4\uC694\uB97C \uB354 \uC900\uB2E4"
      goToNode: need_blanket
    - labelEn: Offer a hot meal
      labelKo: "\uB530\uB73B\uD55C \uC2DD\uC0AC\uB97C \uAD8C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: need_meal
    - labelEn: Nothing for now
      labelKo: "\uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uB410\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: need_blanket
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you. These old knees will thank you.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uAE30\uB3C4 \uD558\uC624. \uC774 \uB299\uC740 \uBB34\uB98E\uC774
        \uACE0\uB9C8\uC6CC\uD560 \uAC8C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: need_meal
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I wouldn't say no to that.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC70\uB77C\uBA74 \uB9C8\uB2E4\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uACA0\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A look-in of a morning would do me fine. I keep to my chair mostly.
      textKo: "\uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uD55C \uBC88 \uB4E4\uC5EC\uB2E4\uBD10 \uC8FC\uBA74
        \uB418\uC624. \uB09C \uAC70\uC758 \uC758\uC790\uC5D0\uB9CC \uC549\uC544 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Tidy up every morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uC815\uB9AC\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Only when he asks
      labelKo: "\uBD80\uD0C1\uD560 \uB54C\uB9CC \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you. An old man sleeps easier for it.
      textKo: "\uBCF5 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2DC\uC624. \uB299\uC740\uC774\uAC00 \uBC1C \uBED7\uACE0
        \uC790\uACA0\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: As you like. I'll call out if I need a hand.
      textKo: "\uC88B\uC744 \uB300\uB85C \uD558\uC2DC\uC624. \uC190\uC774 \uD544\uC694\uD558\uBA74
        \uBD80\uB974\uB9AC\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh. Oh dear. On a night like this?
      textKo: "\uC774\uB7F0. \uC800\uB7F0. \uC774\uB7F0 \uBC24\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC774\uC624?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
