  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I don't move so fast anymore. Have a heart.
      textKo: "\uC774\uC81C \uAC78\uC74C\uB3C4 \uB290\uB9AC\uB2E4\uC624. \uC880 \uBD10\uC8FC\uC2DC\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Refuse
      labelKo: "\uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Let him stay
      labelKo: "\uBB35\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Alright. Sorry to have troubled you.
      textKo: "...\uC54C\uACA0\uC18C. \uADC0\uCC2E\uAC8C \uD574\uC11C \uBBF8\uC548\uD558\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you son. Sleep well now.
      textKo: "\uBCF5 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2DC\uAD6C\uB824. \uD3B8\uD788 \uC8FC\uBB34\uC2DC\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mm? Goodness, at this hour? These old ears barely caught the knock.
      textKo: "\uC74C? \uC544\uC774\uACE0, \uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC5D0? \uB299\uC740
        \uADC0\uB85C\uB294 \uB178\uD06C \uC18C\uB9AC\uB3C4 \uACA8\uC6B0 \uB4E4\uC5C8\uC18C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Come now. What is it, son?
      textKo: "\uC790, \uC790. \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC77C\uC774\uC624, \uC80A\uC740\uC774?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Heard it plain. Something scratching, past the wall. On and on. Told
        myself it was the wind.
      textKo: "\uB611\uB611\uD788 \uB4E4\uC5C8\uC18C. \uBCBD \uB108\uBA38\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBB54\uAC00 \uAE01\uB294 \uC18C\uB9AC. \uACC4\uC18D, \uACC4\uC18D. \uBC14\uB78C\uC774\uACA0\uAC70\uB2C8
        \uD588\uC9C0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: night
    labelEn: Ask what he did all night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC0C8 \uBB58 \uD588\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up twice for the washroom - the knees, you know. The hall was empty
        both times. Dark as a well.
      textKo: "\uD654\uC7A5\uC2E4 \uB450 \uBC88 \uB2E4\uB140\uC654\uC18C - \uBB34\uB98E
        \uB54C\uBB38\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC774\uC624. \uB450 \uBC88 \uB2E4 \uBCF5\uB3C4\uB294
        \uBE44\uC5B4 \uC788\uC5C8\uACE0. \uC6B0\uBB3C \uC18D\uCC98\uB7FC \uCE84\uCE84\uD588\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: storm
    labelEn: Ask about the storm he mentioned
    labelKo: "\uB9D0\uD588\uB358 \uD3ED\uD48D\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Look at the sky before you sleep. It's already turning. Green at the
        edges. It always starts that way.
      textKo: "\uC790\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0 \uD558\uB298\uC744 \uBCF4\uC2DC\uC624. \uBC8C\uC368
        \uBCC0\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC18C. \uAC00\uC7A5\uC790\uB9AC\uBD80\uD130 \uCD08\uB85D\uBE5B\uC73C\uB85C.
        \uB298 \uADF8\uB807\uAC8C \uC2DC\uC791\uD55C\uB2E4\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
